# Chaos: the inventory window draws the badge slot (13) where the ammunition slot (10) was (after 0001-0112). Owner
# decision 2026-10-21 "tire o slot extra de ring e coloque o badge": server src-patch 0058 takes the second ring out of
# slot 10 (it takes nothing now) and lets badges into slot 13. The 10.98 protocol already carries slot 13 both ways
# (0012 sends up to slot 16 into LastInventorySlot 17; a drag uses the widget's position {65535, 13, 0}). Here: the
# constants InventorySlotBadge / CONST_SLOT_BADGE = 13 and InventorySlotsWorn (1-10 and 13); the inventory window's
# AmmoSlot (slot10, ammo image) becomes BadgeSlot (slot13, the badge placeholder of client/tools/gen_skin.py) in both
# layouts, and its change, refresh and blessed-style loops take slot 13; the action bar's equipped look, the item
# lookup of hotkeys and the NPC trade's "ignore equipped" count look at slot 13 too; the equipment preset window's
# slot 10 is the badge slot (a preset saved with slot 10 loads without it). Lua and otui only.
